{"name":"-54-C-9","beats":[{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"9","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"blackscreenOn","value":"0,10","raw":"黑屏1"},{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Empty","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"blackscreenOff","raw":"黑屏2"},{"type":"background","value":"528","raw":"BIN"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":true,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Carriage F09 (Dining Carriage), Intercontinental Railway train \"Future\"."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"whitescreenOn","raw":"白屏1"},{"type":"bgm","value":"GF_2022_Summer_AVG_3","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"The Dolls within the dining carriage seem calm enough, but their real consciousnesses are having a knock-down drag-out fight elsewhere..."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"whitescreenOff","raw":"白屏2"},{"type":"background","value":"249","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_tele_connect","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...Inside Erma's comms channel."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Doll A","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Fight the VORY?! Are you insane?!","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}},{"text":" "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"We're just ordinary civilian Dolls.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Doll B","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I-I can't do it, you don't know how scary these guys are!","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}},{"text":" "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"I'm not even armed...","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Doll C","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"We're kinda fine right now...","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}},{"text":" "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"If we behave, they won't cause us trouble...","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}},{"text":" "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Who'd go all out against a toaster anyway?","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"pref